{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30291","headline":"书斋雪後 · 赵嘏","name":"书斋雪後","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"拥褐坐茅檐，春晴喜初日。\n微风入桃径，爽气归缥帙。\n频时苦风雪，就景理巾栉。\n树暖高鸟来，窗闲曙云出。\n乡遥路难越，道蹇时易失。\n欲静又不能，东山负芝术。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30291.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30291","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}